  "releaseNotes": "1.2026.11.1: First release.\n- Chart Explorer for system and personal charts: table filter, search, sort, paged loading with cancel\n- Favourites and recently opened charts\n- Summary tab: plain-language explanation of each chart\n- XML editor with colouring, line numbers, undo/redo, find/replace, format and live well-formed status\n- Safe save to Dataverse: validation gate, conflict check, confirmation showing environment, URL and diff, backup first, changed columns only, scoped publish of the chart's table, read-back verification\n- Validation: 25 checks (structure, FetchXML, metadata, Unified Interface compatibility) with explanations and go-to-line\n- Diff of your edits against the stored XML\n- Import and export (JSON, chart XML, data or presentation XML), chart list as CSV, local backups\n- Settings saved per connection",
